cadcraft-render-server

A modified build of CADCraft (https://github.com/storytold/cadcraft) at commit
0d4b100209990e485891d85c70ff465c8e709156 of its main branch (also in UPSTREAM_COMMIT).
Source of this build: https://github.com/jianzhichun/cadz-render-server

Changes against that commit:
- left out: docs/brand/ (the ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos, which modified versions must remove)
  and the README's two logos; the README is this repository's own
- new: apps/cadcraft-render-server (this program: the editing UI drawn offscreen and streamed to an
  embedding host over a loopback socket; the host's file dialogs; host read-only; its brand test,
  tests/brand.rs, reads what the interface paints). Parts of it are adapted from
  solidcraft-render-server (https://github.com/jianzhichun/solidz-render-server, MIT OR Apache-2.0),
  whose wire protocol it speaks
- new: crates/engine/src/product.rs (a host product's name in the messages, set once by the host)
  and crates/engine/src/read_only.rs (a process-wide host read-only switch), with their hooks in
  crates/engine/src/lib.rs (Session::echo), crates/engine/src/session/execute.rs and
  crates/engine/src/session/interactive.rs
- changed: crates/ui-egui (the interface's catalogs, status line, Start page heading and fault
  notices under a host product's name; About without CADCraft's credits and links and no update check under one; the Plot
  dialog's device names as shown)
- changed: crates/engine/src/file_access.rs (AutomationRoots::grant: one file granted besides the
  automation roots, for the files a person chooses in the app's own dialogs), and the two control
  methods that write a file outside a command, ui.screenshot and ui.render with a path
  (crates/ui-egui/src/capture.rs, crates/ui-egui/src/control.rs), held to the roots where they are
  in force; this program holds every command of its session to them (--automation-*-root)
- changed: apps/cadcraft/src/control_server.rs (serve_bound: the server on a port and token the
  caller chose, which this program compiles in) and crates/mcp/src/control_token.rs (issue_given:
  the token file written with a token the caller chose)
- changed: xtask/src/layers.rs (registers the new app), Cargo.lock (the new package)
- removed: .github/dependabot.yml (this repository follows upstream commits)

cadcraft-cli in the same release is upstream's, built unmodified from that commit.

